.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH switch 1  "switch " 
.SH NAME
switch \- Move current workspace to an arbitrary revision/ref
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBswitch\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fITARGET\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Move current workspace to an arbitrary revision/ref
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH COLLABORATION
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output structured machine JSON envelope
.TP
<\fITARGET\fR>
The target revision ref to switch to
